[17.990277, "o", "\u001b[1;36mOverview\u001b[0m\r\nscan            \u001b[1mlab-audit\u001b[0m\r\ntransport       corp (http 127.0.0.1:3128)  fidelity \u001b[33mopen_only\u001b[0m\r\nscope           5 probes (1 targets x 5 ports)\r\ntiming          concurrency 512, rate 400/s, connect_timeout 5s\r\nscan id         473e334c  \u001b[2mseed 5aab29c287c8f3d2\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;36mWarnings\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;33mwarning         \u001b[0mproxy `corp` is an HTTP CONNECT proxy, which has no status meaning refused: closed and filtered are indistinguishable through it, so non-open results will be `error`\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;36mResults\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mendpoint             state     service               rtt  banner / tls\u001b[0m\r\n"]
